    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EMERGENCE | Old English in Continental Europe</title>
    
    <!-- Bootstrap CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- Custom CSS -->
    <link href="assets/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
     <!-- Navbar will be loaded here -->
    <div id="navbar-placeholder"></div>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold mb-3">Old English in Continental Europe</h1>
                 <img src="assets/images/logo.oeice.jpg" 
                 alt="Old English in Continental Europe" class="main-logo">
          <p class="lead fs-3 mb-5"><br>A hybrid conference, co-organized by OE-CONNECT (Una Europa; Jagiellonian University Kraków – Leiden University – University of Zurich) and EMERGENCE (ERC Horizon Europe; Leiden University).</p></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Placeholder Content -->
    <section class="py-3">
        <div class="container text-center">
             <p class="fs-5">
We warmly invite researchers and teachers working on the linguistic and cultural heritage of early medieval 
England (c. 500–1100 CE) to attend this hybrid conference on Old English in Continental Europe, to take place 
at Leiden University (& online, via Zoom) from 26-27 January 2027. The event seeks to bring together scholars to exchange research, 
teaching practices, and resources, as well as to consider the particular opportunities and challenges of studying 
and teaching Old English beyond the Anglophone world.<br><br>
Our preliminary programme features 21 speakers from 8 different countries:</p>        

                <div style="background-color: #A0522D; color: black; padding: 35px; border-radius: 5px;" class="fs-4">
    <a href="assets/files/OEiCE.PrelProgramme.pdf" target="_blank"><b>PRELIMINARY PROGRAMME (PDF)</b></a>
                </div>
        <p class="mt-3 fs-5"><br> Attendance is free (including lunch, coffee/tea and closing drinks), but registration is required. If you are interested in attending conference, please let us know by filling out the registration form below:
        </p>
        </div>
    </section>

        <!-- Contact form -->
    <section class="py-3">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="text-center mb-5">Registration form (or use <a href="https://leidenuniv.eu.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_d5zGPKeWI9L7mw6" target="_blank">this link</a>)</h2>
            <div class="row justify-content-center">    
                <div class="qualtrics-container">
                  <iframe 
                    id="qualtrics-iframe"
                    src="https://leidenuniv.eu.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_d5zGPKeWI9L7mw6"
                    width="100%" 
                    height="1500" 
                    frameborder="0" 
                    marginheight="0" 
                    marginwidth="0"
                    allowfullscreen>
                  </iframe>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

